,"text":"USGS"},{"box":[[849.0,753.0],[935.0,756.0],[934.0,787.0],[848.0,784.0]],"confidence":0.79038,"text":"USGS"},{"box":[[455.0,767.0],[476.0,767.0],[476.0,779.0],[455.0,779.0]],"confidence":0.612714,"text":"NASA"},{"box":[[959.0,767.0],[979.0,767.0],[979.0,779.0],[959.0,779.0]],"confidence":0.701623,"text":"NAS"},{"box":[[464.0,958.0],[539.0,958.0],[539.0,971.0],[464.0,971.0]],"confidence":0.815636,"text":"Mendenhall Lake"},{"box":[[370.0,1040.0],[466.0,1037.0],[466.0,1061.0],[371.0,1064.0]],"confidence":0.84506,"text":"Landsat 5"},{"box":[[876.0,1041.0],[971.0,1041.0],[971.0,1062.0],[876.0,1062.0]],"confidence":0.794114,"text":"Landsat 8"},{"box":[[350.0,1065.0],[489.0,1065.0],[489.0,1088.0],[350.0,1088.0]],"confidence":0.859582,"text":"August 17,1984"},{"box":[[862.0,1067.0],[981.0,1064.0],[982.0,1088.0],[863.0,1091.0]],"confidence":0.847326,"text":"May 16,2014"},{"box":[[349.0,1131.0],[1307.0,1129.0],[1307.0,1162.0],[349.0,1165.0]],"confidence":0.933168,"text":"Figure 1: Comparison Chart of the Ablation of Mendenhall Glacier"},{"box":[[281.0,1172.0],[1438.0,1174.0],[1438.0,1210.0],[281.0,1209.0]],"confidence":0.942216,"text":"The data above comes from the website of USGS [2]. It clearly shows that Mendenhall"},{"box":[[216.0,1218.0],[1165.0,1219.0],[1165.0,1255.0],[216.0,1254.0]],"confidence":0.898795,"text":"Lake expanded significantly from 1984 to 2014 due to glacier ablation."},{"box":[[265.0,1286.0],[1454.0,1287.0],[1454.0,1323.0],[265.0,1322.0]],"confidence":0.954115,"text":"Since 1997, Juneau has implemented the Tourism Best Management Practices (TBMP)"},{"box":[[199.0,1334.0],[1451.0,1334.0],[1451.0,1367.0],[199.0,1367.0]],"confidence":0.95015,"text":"to better manage the tourism industry[3]. In recent years, faced with more severe tourism prob-"},{"box":[[197.0,1378.0],[1451.0,1380.0],[1451.0,1413.0],[197.0,1411.0]],"confidence":0.948472,"text":"lems, Juneau has taken measures including controlling the number of tourists, increasing tour-"},{"box":[[